 superorchestrator 0.1.0  ● supervisor up 1h  ~/.config/superorchestrator
 1 Dashboard 2 Sessions 3 Runs !1 4 Accounts 5 Usage 6 Levels 7 Models 8 Settings 9 Setup
  First-run steps. Safe to repeat; each does only what is missing.

    ✓ init          create the config dir, config.toml, levels and catalog
  ▸ ✓ harnesses     find the harness binaries on PATH
    ○ import        import logins found on disk as accounts
    ○ add accounts  add one account for each installed harness without one
    ! sign in       list accounts that are signed out and how to sign in
    ✗ install       register the MCP server, skills and CLAUDE.md block
    ○ doctor        check binaries, config, database, socket and sign-ins

